# Hero footage. The current campus-tour.mp4 is ~134 MB, over GitHub's hard
# 100 MB per-file limit, so committing it makes `git push` fail outright.
# Transcode it (see README "Before go-live") and remove this rule, or host the
# file on a CDN. While it is ignored the hero falls back to its poster frame.
public/videos/*.mp4
public/videos/*.webm
